>.</p>
<h2 style="position: relative;" line-start="633" line-end="633"><span style="position: absolute; top: -50px;" id="block-latex"></span>Block LaTeX<a class="anchor octicon-link" href="#block-latex"></a></h2>
<p line-start="635" line-end="635">Block math using double dollar signs:</p>
